# OpenGWAS API token
#
# 1. Register at https://api.opengwas.io  (free for academic use)
# 2. Copy this file:
#       cp config/opengwas_token.txt.example config/opengwas_token.txt
# 3. Replace the placeholder below with your JWT, on a single line, no quotes,
#    no trailing spaces. The token is a long string starting with "eyJ".
#
# config/opengwas_token.txt is excluded by .gitignore and must never be committed.
# The pipeline reads it through scripts/lib_io.py:token().

PASTE_YOUR_OPENGWAS_JWT_HERE
